      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北港火山做给我的巧克力，\n有着能传达慰劳心意的温和甜味──",
      "source_fingerprint": "106f2418129d87e3247702781a69aef8d1d7d76c893cfa3511008e65d8151d52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
